#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: the node's device was deleted, so the node can only be disabled."
msgstr "Na'ura: an share na'urar kullin, don haka za a iya kashe kullin ne kawai."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: choose an existing Cacti device."
msgstr "Na'ura: zaɓi na'urar Cacti da ke wanzuwa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: this device is already a GPU node."
msgstr "Na'ura: wannan na'urar tuni kullin GPU ce."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was saved."
msgstr "An adana kullin GPU."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node could not be saved."
msgstr "Ba a iya adana kullin GPU ba."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was removed. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "An cire kullin GPU. An bar na'urar Cacti ɗinsa a wurinta."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "Ba a cire kullin GPU ba saboda akwai bayanan GPU da ke cikinsa. Kashe shi a maimakon haka; ba a taɓa share bayanan GPU ba."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU now belongs to the node it was seen at, with its history."
msgstr "Yanzu GPU ɗin yana ƙarƙashin kullin da aka gan shi a kai, tare da tarihinsa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU stays with its recorded node."
msgstr "GPU ɗin zai ci gaba da kasancewa tare da kullin da aka yi masa rajista."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU will leave the data query at the next reindex. Its graphs and RRD files are kept."
msgstr "GPU ɗin zai bar binciken bayanai a sake jera bayanai na gaba. Za a adana jadawalansa da fayilolin RRD."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Only an absent GPU can be removed from the data query."
msgstr "GPU da ba ya nan ne kawai za a iya cirewa daga binciken bayanai."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Creating a device needs permission to manage Cacti devices."
msgstr "Ƙirƙirar na'ura tana buƙatar izinin sarrafa na'urorin Cacti."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Description: enter up to 150 printable characters."
msgstr "Bayani: shigar da haruffan da za a iya bugawa har zuwa 150."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Hostname: enter a host name or IP address."
msgstr "Sunan na'ura (Hostname): shigar da sunan na'ura ko adireshin IP."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU Node device template is not installed."
msgstr "Ba a girka samfurin na'ura na Kullin GPU ba."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device was not kept: your account may not see devices it creates. Ask an administrator to create it."
msgstr "Ba a adana na'urar ba: asusunka ba ya da izinin ganin na'urorin da ya ƙirƙira. Nemi mai gudanarwa ya ƙirƙire ta."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be removed after access was refused. Ask an administrator to remove it."
msgstr "Ba a iya cire na'urar ba bayan an hana izinin shiga. Nemi mai gudanarwa ya cire ta."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device and its GPU node were created. Set the device's SNMP settings on its device page."
msgstr "An ƙirƙiri na'urar da kullin GPU ɗinta. Saita saitunan SNMP na na'urar a shafinta."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be created; see the Cacti log."
