#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Saving adds the GPU data query to the device, with Cacti's automatic reindex turned off: the plugin reindexes after every GPU change. Configure the device's SNMP agent first; see docs/node-setup.md."
msgstr "Adanawa yana ƙara binciken bayanan GPU ga na'urar, tare da kashe sake jera bayanai na atomatik na Cacti: karin yana sake jera bayanai bayan kowane canjin GPU. Saita saitunan SNMP na na'urar a shafinta."

