#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "An absent GPU stays an index of the data query, so its graphs and RRD files stay attached and show a gap. Removing it from the data query stops that: at the next reindex Cacti no longer lists it, its graphs stop updating and its data sources show as orphaned, and its RRD files and graphs are kept until you delete them. The GPU record stays, and the GPU returns to the data query if it is reported again."
msgstr "GPU da ba ya nan yana ci gaba da kasancewa a cikin fihirisar binciken bayanai, don haka jadawalansa da fayilolin RRD suke ci gaba da kasancewa a haɗe kuma su nuna giɓi. Cire shi daga binciken bayanai zai dakatar da hakan: a sake jera bayanai na gaba Cacti ba zai ƙara jero shi ba, jadawalansa za su daina sabuntawa kuma tushen bayanansa za su nuna a matsayin marayu, kuma za a adana fayilolin RRD da jadawalansa har sai ka share su. Rajistar GPU za ta ci gaba da kasancewa, kuma GPU ɗin zai dawo cikin binciken bayanai idan an sake bayar da rahotonsa."

