#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Mark Absent After"
msgstr "Yi Alama Ba Ya Nan Bayan"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Consecutive successful collections that must miss a GPU before it is marked absent, from 1 to 100. A failed collection, or one that reports no GPUs, never counts. Absent GPUs keep their records and history and are never deleted automatically."
msgstr "Yawan nasarorin tattara bayanai a jere da dole ne su rasa GPU kafin a yi masa alama ba ya nan, daga 1 zuwa 100. Tattara bayanan da ya gaza, ko wanda bai ruwaito wani GPU ba, ba ya ƙidayuwa. GPU da ba su nan suna riƙe da rajistarsu da tarihinsu kuma ba a taɓa share su kai tsaye."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "GPU Collection"
msgstr "Tattara Bayanan GPU"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Ya Wuce Lokaci Bayan"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds after the tool took a sample that its values stop being graphed, from 60 to 86400. An older value is reported as unknown, so a stopped collection shows as a gap, never as a flat line. The GPU age value keeps counting so it can be alerted on."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙi bayan kayan aikin ya ɗauki samfur da ƙimominsa za su daina fitowa a jadawali, daga 60 zuwa 86400. Tsohuwar ƙima ana ruwaito ta a matsayin ba a sani ba, saboda haka tattara bayanan da ya tsaya yana nuna a matsayin gibi, ba a matsayin layi miƙaƙƙe ba. Ƙimar tsawon lokacin GPU tana ci gaba da ƙidaya domin a iya ba da gargaɗi akanta."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Riƙe Teburan Plugin yayin Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its node and GPU records. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export them first from GPU Nodes. Cacti devices, data sources, graphs, and RRD files are never touched either way."
msgstr "Idan aka zaɓa, cire plugin ɗin zai riƙe rajistar node da GPU ɗinsa. A share zaɓin domin cire plugin ɗin ya zubar da su; a fitar da su tukuna daga GPU Nodes. Ba a taɓa taɓa na'urorin Cacti, tushen bayanai, jadawalai, da fayilolin RRD ta kowace hanya."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Remove the plugin's Cacti objects on uninstall"
msgstr "Cire abubuwan Cacti na plugin ɗin yayin cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin also removes the GPU device template, data query, data template, and graph templates it imported, each only where nothing outside the plugin uses it, and the GPU data query XML it wrote, only if the file is unchanged. It never deletes RRD files, devices, graphs, or data sources; templates those still use are kept."
msgstr "Idan aka zaɓa, cire plugin ɗin zai kuma cire samfurin na'urar GPU, binciken bayanai, samfurin bayanai, da samfuran jadawali da ya shigo da su, kowanne idan babu wani abu a wajen plugin ɗin da ke amfani da shi kaɗai, da kuma XML na binciken bayanan GPU da ya rubuta, idan fayil ɗin bai canza ba kaɗai. Ba ya taɓa share fayilolin RRD, na'urori, jadawalai, ko tushen bayanai; ana riƙe samfuran da waɗancan ke ci gaba da amfani da su."

